Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "Tunnel_Lateral_Intrusion" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :BehaviorAnomaly ;
    :occursInScene :scene1 ;
    :hasActor :vehicle1 ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :night1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1 .

:vehicle1 a :Vehicle ;
    :description "White vehicle performing an abrupt lateral maneuver across the lane" .

:night1 a :NightCondition .

:risk1 a :LaneIntrusionRisk ;
    :description "Vehicle unexpectedly intruding into the ego vehicle's lane in a tunnel environment" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 ;
    :confidenceScore "0.95"^^xsd:float .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.90"^^xsd:float .

Identified Risks for each risk class
Risk 1:
Description: Vehicle unexpectedly intruding into the ego vehicle's lane in a tunnel environment.
Severity Score: 0.90